WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.893
Mrs. Wiggles grinned.

2
00:00:13.894 --> 00:00:18.511
"We're so happy to see you, Rocket Girl.

3
00:00:18.512 --> 00:00:22.161
Our plan was to suck you out of school."

4
00:00:22.162 --> 00:00:24.814
Mr. Presto chuckled.

5
00:00:24.815 --> 00:00:29.099
"That didn't work. But luckily you showed up anyway."

6
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.639
"What do you want?" Roxy demanded.

7
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.329
Dr. Odd cackled.

8
00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:37.355
"We want to get rid of you—once and for all!"

9
00:00:37.356 --> 00:00:41.296
He fired an energy blast at Roxy. Ba-zoom!

10
00:00:41.297 --> 00:00:43.742
"Whoa!" Roxy jumped.

11
00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:47.464
Mr. Presto waved his wand. "Presto!"

12
00:00:47.465 --> 00:00:51.018
A brick wall appeared. Bam!

13
00:00:51.019 --> 00:00:53.453
"Oof!" Roxy fell on her back.

14
00:00:53.454 --> 00:00:58.160
Stomp, stomp! The robot rushed toward Roxy.

15
00:00:58.161 --> 00:01:00.510
A heavy foot came down on her.

16
00:01:00.511 --> 00:01:02.436
Roxy grabbed the foot.

17
00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.666
She flipped the robot backward.

18
00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:08.638
Crash! The building shook.

19
00:01:08.639 --> 00:01:12.134
"Gah!" Dr. Odd cried.

20
00:01:12.135 --> 00:01:14.599
Principal Penn saw the wall shake.

21
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.289
She looked around.

22
00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.341
No one was guarding them anymore.

23
00:01:18.342 --> 00:01:21.351
"Everyone, back to school!"

24
00:01:21.352 --> 00:01:24.233
The teachers and students hurried outside.

25
00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:26.455
Mr. Presto waved his wand again.

26
00:01:26.456 --> 00:01:30.526
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

27
00:01:30.527 --> 00:01:34.088
But Mr. Presto vanished before they struck.

28
00:01:34.089 --> 00:01:37.125
Roxy felt the licorice rope wrap around her.

29
00:01:37.126 --> 00:01:40.209
"Got you!" Mrs. Wiggles shouted.

30
00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:44.222
Roxy groaned. "I hate licorice!"

31
00:01:44.223 --> 00:01:48.473
Ba-zoom! An energy blast knocked Roxy over.

32
00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.021
Outside, Terrell heard the noise.

33
00:01:51.022 --> 00:01:57.736
"Roxy's in trouble!" He climbed through a window.

34
00:01:57.737 --> 00:02:00.199
Mr. Presto raised his wand.

35
00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:04.198
Whoosh! Roxy used her super breath.

36
00:02:04.199 --> 00:02:07.368
The wand flew from his hand.

37
00:02:07.369 --> 00:02:09.534
Terrell caught it!

38
00:02:09.535 --> 00:02:12.345
Roxy smiled. "Terrell!"

39
00:02:12.346 --> 00:02:16.129
"Don't move!" Terrell pointed the wand at the magician.

40
00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:18.306
Mr. Presto held up his hands.

41
00:02:18.307 --> 00:02:21.097
"Don't cast a spell on me!"

42
00:02:21.098 --> 00:02:25.445
Mrs. Wiggles dropped the licorice rope and ran for the door.

43
00:02:25.446 --> 00:02:28.560
"You'll never catch me!"

44
00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:31.437
Roxy quickly freed herself.

45
00:02:31.438 --> 00:02:35.106
She swung the licorice rope and caught Mrs. Wiggles.

46
00:02:35.107 --> 00:02:39.355
"No!" the villain cried.

47
00:02:39.356 --> 00:02:42.254
Roxy heard heavy footsteps.

48
00:02:42.255 --> 00:02:44.932
Dr. Odd was running toward Terrell.

49
00:02:44.933 --> 00:02:48.634
"Get my wand!" Mr. Presto yelled to Dr. Odd.

50
00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:52.278
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

51
00:02:52.279 --> 00:02:59.790
The robot exploded. Dr. Odd lay on the floor, moaning.

52
00:02:59.791 --> 00:03:02.894
Roxy quickly tied up the villains with the licorice rope.

53
00:03:02.895 --> 00:03:04.821
Then she turned to Terrell.

54
00:03:04.822 --> 00:03:08.155
"Thanks for the help! Ready to fly?"

55
00:03:08.156 --> 00:03:10.157
Terrell's face lit up.

56
00:03:10.158 --> 00:03:12.405
Roxy held Terrell with one hand.

57
00:03:12.406 --> 00:03:15.782
She held the bundled villains with the other.

58
00:03:15.783 --> 00:03:21.093
"Whoa!" Terrell laughed as he and Roxy soared over Metro City.

59
00:03:21.094 --> 00:03:25.221
They dropped off the villains at prison.

60
00:03:25.222 --> 00:03:28.856
Then he and Roxy returned to school.

61
00:03:28.857 --> 00:03:31.789
"Roxy, Terrell!" Mara said.

62
00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.510
"You missed everything!

63
00:03:33.511 --> 00:03:36.714
Villains kidnapped everyone from school."

64
00:03:36.715 --> 00:03:39.780
"Rocket Girl saved us!" Jack said.

65
00:03:39.781 --> 00:03:42.938
"Really?" Roxy pretended to be surprised.

66
00:03:42.939 --> 00:03:46.548
"I can't believe we missed that!" Terrell said.

67
00:03:46.549 --> 00:03:48.522
He glanced at Roxy.

68
00:03:48.523 --> 00:03:54.190
The two friends chuckled.
